#N canvas 20 20 1120 1000 10;
#X text 240 20 S3.4 handshake legs 1-2 (sec 4.1/4.4/4.6). decode then branch on operation. hello -> [ecodec build_hello] (200 + connect/hello). authenticate -> the sec 4.6 proof-of-possession GUARD LADDER on the canvas: auth_decode -> nonce-echo -> signature -> identity-binding -> [ecodec build_grant] (200 + capability/grant) with each rung failing to its coded 401. Bytes CBOR and crypto live in [ecodec] while the sequence and guards are authored here.;
